{
"Items.WizardStaff.Desc": "This staff is made of very old wood and seems to tingle to the touch. The top has an odd zig-zag shape to it, and the wood is worn smooth from lots of use. It probably belonged to a wizard at some point and would aid magic use."
"Items.WizardStaff.Long": "a wizard's staff"
"Items.WizardStaff.Short": "Wizard Staff"
